2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     CROSSES its session VWAP (bar opens one side, closes the other) with body
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     65-86% AND whose close is > FUT5_SCALP_SR_MIN_DIST (20pt) from EVERY one of
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     yesterday's classic pivots S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Exit is
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     a FIXED +FUT5_SCALP_TARGET_PTS (12) option points (HARDSL + 15:25 force-close
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     still apply; NO trail/SMA8). One trade per event: deduped on the 5m bar ts,
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     so the next entry needs a fresh qualifying cross. check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: ">20 points away from s1/r1/s2/r2" = min distance to ALL four
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     pivots > 20pt (price in clear space, not hugging a pivot). "cross" = bar
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     open & close on opposite sides of VWAP. Pivots = classic floor-trader pivots
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     from the prior trading day's H/L/C. If wrong, adjust compute_classic_pivots()
2026-09-10 03:32:06,486 [INFO]     / check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
